[00:00.000] 作词 : Greg Kurstin/Adele Adkins
[00:01.000] 作曲 : Greg Kurstin/Adele Adkins
[00:12.755]There ain't no gold in this river
[00:12.755]你我间那情愫的河流中已再无金石般的存在
[00:19.752]That I've been washing my hands in forever
[00:19.752]我总是想要就此脱身
[00:26.232]I know there is hope in these waters
[00:26.232]我知晓这些水流 卷携着涌动的希望
[00:32.999]But I can't bring myself to swim
[00:32.999]但我无法令自己 安然畅游其间
[00:36.903]When I am drowning in this silence
[00:36.903]当我沉浸于那一片寂静之中
[00:41.757]Baby, let me in
[00:41.757]我的挚爱 请敞开心扉将我接纳
[00:44.413]
[00:46.808]Go easy on me, baby
