[00:56.829]Didn't get the chance to
[00:56.829]还未曾有机会去
[01:00.870]Feel the world around me
[01:00.870]体会身边那广阔的世界
[01:06.473]I had no time to choose what I chose to do
[01:06.473]也并无时日去选择我曾经立下的志向
[01:13.801]So go easy on me
